{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01236","headline":"相和歌辞 善哉行 · 僧齐己","name":"相和歌辞 善哉行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大鹏刷翮谢溟渤，青云万层高突出。\n下视秋涛空渺弥，旧处鱼龙皆细物。\n人生在世何容易，眼浊心昏信生死。\n愿除嗜慾待身轻，携手同寻列仙事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}